#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:1
msgid "PLUMED Masterclass 21.6: Dimensionality reduction"
msgstr "PLUMED Masterclass 21.6：Dimensionality Reduction"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:3
msgid "Aims"
msgstr "目的"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:5
msgid ""
"The primary aim of this Masterclass is to show you how you might use PLUMED "
"in your work. We will see how to call PLUMED from a python notebook and "
"discuss some strategies for selecting collective variables."
msgstr ""
"この Masterclass の主な目的は、自身の研究で PLUMED をどのように活用できるかを示すことである。Python Notebook から "
"PLUMED を呼び出す方法を学び、Collective Variables を選ぶための戦略を検討する。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:9
msgid "Objectives"
msgstr "到達目標"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:11
msgid "Once this series of exercises is completed, users will be able to:"
msgstr "この演習を終えると、次ができます。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:13
msgid "Run dimensionality reduction algorithms with PLUMED"
msgstr "PLUMED で Dimensionality Reduction を実行する。"

