msgid ""
"You can find more information on the dimensionality reduction algorithms "
"that we are using in this section in [this "
"paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1907.04170)."
msgstr "アルゴリズムの詳細は [この論文](https://arxiv.org/abs/1907.04170) にあります。"

# Literal notation or identifier intentionally preserved.
#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:72
msgid "PCA"
msgstr "PCA"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:74
msgid ""
"Having learned how to store data for later analysis with a dimensionality "
"reduction algorithm, lets now apply principal component analysis (PCA) upon "
"our stored data. In principle component analysis, low dimensional "
"projections for our trajectory are constructed by:"
msgstr "保存データに Principal Component Analysis (PCA) を適用します。低次元射影は次の手順です。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:77
msgid "Computing a covariance matrix from the trajectory data"
msgstr "Trajectory から Covariance Matrix を計算する。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:78
msgid "Diagonalizing the covariance matrix."
msgstr "Matrix を対角化する。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:79
msgid ""
"Calculating the projection of each trajectory frame on a subset of the "
"eigenvectors of the covariance matrix."
msgstr "各 Frame を Covariance Matrix の一部の Eigenvector に射影する。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:81
msgid ""
"To perform PCA using PLUMED, we are going to use the following input with "
"the blanks filled in:"
msgstr "次の入力の空欄を埋めて PCA を行います。"

