#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:374
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "まとめ"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:376
msgid ""
"This exercise has shown you that running dimensionality reduction algorithms"
" using PLUMED involves the following stages:"
msgstr "PLUMED の Dimensionality Reduction は次の段階です。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:378
msgid ""
"Data is collected from the trajectory using "
"[COLLECT_FRAMES](https://www.plumed.org/doc-master/user-"
"doc/html/_c_o_l_l_e_c_t__f_r_a_m_e_s.html)."
msgstr ""
"[COLLECT_FRAMES](https://www.plumed.org/doc-master/user-"
"doc/html/_c_o_l_l_e_c_t__f_r_a_m_e_s.html) でデータを集める。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:379
msgid ""
"Landmark points are selected using a [landmarks "
"algorithm](https://www.plumed.org/doc-master/user-"
"doc/html/_analysis.html#landmarks)"
msgstr ""
"[Landmark アルゴリズム](https://www.plumed.org/doc-master/user-"
"doc/html/_analysis.html#landmarks) で点を選ぶ。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:380
msgid "A loss function is optimized to generate projections of the landmarks."
msgstr "Loss Function を最適化し Landmark の射影を作る。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:381
msgid "Projections of the non-landmark points are found"
msgstr "残りの点を射影する。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:383
msgid ""
"There are multiple choices to be made in each of the various stages "
"described above. For example, you can change the particular sort of data "
"this is collected from the trajectory. There are multiple different ways to "
"select landmarks. You can use the distances directly, or you can transform "
"them. You can use various loss functions and optimize the loss function "
"using a variety of different algorithms. When you tackle your own research "
"problems using these methods, you can experiment with the various choices "
"that can be made."
msgstr ""
"各段階で、収集データ、Landmark 選択、距離の直接使用・変換、Loss Function、最適化法などを選べます。研究では各選択を試せます。"

#: DIMENSIONALITY.md:388
msgid ""
"__Generating a low-dimensional representation using these algorithms is not "
"enough to publish a paper.__ We want to get some physical understanding from"
" our simulation. Gaining this understanding is the hard part."
msgstr "__低次元表示を作るだけでは論文にはなりません。__ 物理的理解を得ることが難しい部分です。"
